          <div class="field_cols">
            <div class="field_desc">
              <h3>Unique Student Identifier - USI</h3>
              <p>
                From 1 January 2015, we (EXELTrain Pty Ltd) can be prevented from issuing you with a nationally
                recognised VET qualification or statement of attainment when you complete your course if you do not have
                a unique student identifier (USI). In addition, we are required to include your USI in the data we
                submit to NCVER. If you have not yet obtained a USI,
                <b
                  ><a href="http://www.usi.gov.au/create-your-USI" target="_blank"
                    >you can apply for it directly here to create one</a
                  ></b
                >
                on your computer or mobile device. If you need further information on USI please visit www.usi.gov.au or
                contact our office on 1300 848 302 during business hours. Please note that if you would like to specify
                your gender as 'other' you will need to contact the USI office for assistance.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="field_new  field_full field_with_text ">
              <label for="please-enter-your-usi-number">Please enter your USI number:</label>
              <input
                required
                class="required"
                id="please-enter-your-usi-number"
                type="text"
                name="contact[Please enter your USI number]"
              >
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="field_cols">
            <div class="field_new  field_full   ">
              <input type="hidden" name="contact[  USI Search (if required)]" value="No">
              <input
                id="usi-search-if-required"
                type="checkbox"
                name="contact[  USI Search (if required)]"
                value="Yes"
              >
              <label for="usi-search-if-required"> USI Search (if required)</label><br>
              <p>
                By ticking this box and signing this form you acknowledge that you are providing us with the permission
                to search for your USI number if required. You will also be required to provide us with the necessary
                details. Please note the USI search/locate function tool will activate a notification to your email
                address or mobile of the student account holder which will include the name of our RTO (EXELTrain Pty
                Ltd). For more information please visit this
                <a
                  href="https://www.usi.gov.au/training-organisations/using-usi-registry-system/existing-usi-search-locate-usi"
                  target="_blank"
                  >USI link</a
                >.
              </p>
              <p>
                For further information about Unique Student Identifiers, including access, correction and complaints,
                go to the
                <a href="https://www.usi.gov.au/about/privacy-and-unique-student-identifier" target="_blank"
                  >USI website</a
                >.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
